    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Tara Hodge",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107592649753303649970/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKxW3dWs9mII0khgByr0lOWqNfyr_d87BgTFwECUq6buCnxWQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Deirdre is such a treat to work with. Her knowledge of multiple mediums, pure talent for sharing her techniques, and passion for the arts allows the students to fully engage and dive into creating with her. Thank you Deirdre.",
        "time": 1741211918,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kelly Collins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116907978883426842980/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUKBo2k_Q14pqB4lIQzC4IMh_Unqq59I2Ie8AJMbb4Iv8N3122d=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "My kids have taken art classes with Deirdre both online and in person—and they absolutely loved them! We enjoyed the experience so much that we even asked Deirdre to host a Scout meeting. She is incredibly informative and patient with the children, encouraging their own creativity while gently guiding them through new techniques. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1752799631,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ruth Myriam Bernal",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106622121831051571766/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWytV7VyxHZ3mJ-Mnw3EI5W2EhlWRSNlssqxp4e8eshXOPasBmv=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Having had the opportunity to participate in a weekly doodle workshop offered by Deirdre Potash during this summer, I was surprised by the quality of my learning.  Deirdre as an artist has contributed to my enjoyment while experimenting with art and to the excitement of discovering new sources of inspiration.    Her natural style as a teacher has motivated me to approach art with curiosity and commitment.  As a teacher, as an artist, as a communicator Deirdre's workshops have increased my level of comfort, my ability to enjoy the process, and my desire to keep learning.  Any opportunity to create art with Deirdre has brought value to my creative experience.",
        "time": 1598356998,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Selina Catinelli",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112840348546282265680/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXi8_CNLVc3er0B5B17PA_UTHEbXvI4Vf_f-DVGXHMpGLzmRs7idQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Deirdre is incredible at her work! She is passionate, experienced and incredibly creative in her lessons. She knows how to engage the students she works with and they are always proud of themselves by the end of the activity.\nShe is a breath of fresh air and is continuously giving original and educational lessons, no exceptions. She is one of a kind in her field and if you haven’t hired her yet, find a way!",
        "time": 1619053436,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Pierrette Turcotte",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109625825658138096418/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUL9e6AiDKJoQ44DPlNpNvHtfe8Hlugh37ZeKbaFh9Nm3tw1niO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Deirdre is warm, incredibly competent, and makes us feel good 😌 even if our creation isn't amazing!\nVery respectful and so kind ❣️🤗😉",
        "time": 1665532414,
        "translated": true
      }
